1
00:00:00,533 --> 00:00:02,185
Perang Dunia Kedua berakhir

2
00:00:02,205 --> 00:00:04,003
tahun 1945.

3
00:00:04,023 --> 00:00:06,491
Tapi satu tentara Jepang terus

4
00:00:06,511 --> 00:00:08,401
bertempur di hutan Filipina,

5
00:00:08,421 --> 00:00:10,138
sampai 1974.

6
00:00:10,158 --> 00:00:11,554
Namanya Hiroo Onoda,

7
00:00:11,574 --> 00:00:12,545
letnan dua.

8
00:00:12,565 --> 00:00:13,706
Akhir 1944,

9
00:00:13,726 --> 00:00:15,436
ia dikirim ke Pulau Lubang,

10
00:00:15,456 --> 00:00:17,144
Filipina, untuk bergerilya.

11
00:00:17,164 --> 00:00:18,134
Perintahnya tegas:

12
00:00:18,154 --> 00:00:19,125
jangan menyerah,

13
00:00:19,145 --> 00:00:20,229
dan jangan bunuh diri.

14
00:00:20,249 --> 00:00:22,550
Februari 1945,

15
00:00:22,570 --> 00:00:23,928
pasukan Amerika dan Filipina

16
00:00:23,948 --> 00:00:25,492
merebut pulau itu.

17
00:00:25,512 --> 00:00:27,086
Onoda dan tiga anak buahnya

18
00:00:27,106 --> 00:00:28,337
lari ke pegunungan.

19
00:00:28,357 --> 00:00:29,746
Oktober tahun itu,

20
00:00:29,766 --> 00:00:31,667
mereka menemukan selebaran:

21
00:00:31,687 --> 00:00:33,246
perang sudah berakhir 15

22
00:00:33,266 --> 00:00:34,071
Agustus.

23
00:00:34,091 --> 00:00:34,937
Mereka menganggapnya

24
00:00:34,957 --> 00:00:36,125
propaganda musuh.

25
00:00:36,145 --> 00:00:37,596
Surat keluarga dari udara pun

26
00:00:37,616 --> 00:00:38,545
dianggap tipuan.

27
00:00:38,565 --> 00:00:39,962
Satu anak buahnya menyerah

28
00:00:39,982 --> 00:00:41,408
tahun 1950.

29
00:00:41,428 --> 00:00:43,530
Dua lainnya tewas dalam baku

30
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:47,225
tembak, tahun 1954 dan 1972.

31
00:00:47,245 --> 00:00:47,983
Selama itu,

32
00:00:48,003 --> 00:00:49,539
mereka menyerang warga.

33
00:00:49,559 --> 00:00:51,819
Onoda diduga membunuh hingga

34
00:00:51,839 --> 00:00:53,233
30 orang di pulau itu.

35
00:00:53,253 --> 00:00:54,933
Februari 1974,

36
00:00:54,953 --> 00:00:55,955
petualang Jepang,

37
00:00:55,975 --> 00:00:57,023
Norio Suzuki,

38
00:00:57,043 --> 00:00:58,070
menemukannya.

39
00:00:58,090 --> 00:00:59,602
Onoda menolak menyerah tanpa

40
00:00:59,622 --> 00:01:01,026
perintah komandan.

41
00:01:01,046 --> 00:01:03,481
Maka mantan atasannya,

42
00:01:03,501 --> 00:01:05,282
Mayor Yoshimi Taniguchi,

43
00:01:05,302 --> 00:01:07,015
yang sudah jadi penjual buku,

44
00:01:07,035 --> 00:01:08,254
terbang ke Lubang dan

45
00:01:08,274 --> 00:01:09,281
membacakan perintah.

46
00:01:09,301 --> 00:01:10,079
Sepuluh Maret,

47
00:01:10,099 --> 00:01:11,477
Onoda menyerah.

48
00:01:11,497 --> 00:01:12,654
Presiden Marcos memberinya

49
00:01:12,674 --> 00:01:13,768
pengampunan.

50
00:01:13,788 --> 00:01:14,697
Di Jepang ia disambut bak

51
00:01:14,717 --> 00:01:15,858
pahlawan, meski sejarawan

52
00:01:15,878 --> 00:01:17,360
meragukan ia benar-benar tidak

53
00:01:17,380 --> 00:01:18,381
tahu perang sudah usai.

54
00:01:18,401 --> 00:01:19,779
Ia punya radio transistor.

55
00:01:19,799 --> 00:01:21,467
Hampir 29 tahun.

56
00:01:21,487 --> 00:01:22,993
Dan ada yang lebih lama:

57
00:01:23,013 --> 00:01:24,847
Prajurit Teruo Nakamura,

58
00:01:24,867 --> 00:01:26,163
ditangkap akhir tahun itu di

59
00:01:26,183 --> 00:01:26,995
Indonesia.

60
00:01:27,015 --> 00:01:28,079
Menurut kamu,

61
00:01:28,099 --> 00:01:29,249
Onoda setia,

62
00:01:29,269 --> 00:01:30,797
atau keras kepala yang memakan

63
00:01:30,817 --> 00:01:31,651
korban?

